ak-normal border\">CMYK and Pantone color matching available<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Embossing, Debossing, Foil stamping<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">QR codes, Barcodes, Custom branding inserts<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Marketing materials, Brand packaging, Promotional boxes<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff\/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super\/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark\/30 dark:hover:decoration-super\/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline inline-block align-top\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Sustainability<\/button><\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Eco-friendly options available<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">100% Recyclable materials, Biodegradable inks<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Water-based coatings<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Reusable designs, Compostable materials<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Environmentally conscious packaging, Green product lines<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff\/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super\/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark\/30 dark:hover:decoration-super\/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline inline-block align-top\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Additional Features<\/button><\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Optional features for enhanced functionality<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Reinforced corners, Double-wall corrugation<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">UV spot varnish, Soft-touch lamination<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Handles, Ribbons, Custom inserts<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Luxury packaging, Specialty product protection, Event packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p>We also support die-cut cube styles and logo cut-outs for retail-ready displays.<\/p>\n<h3>Use Cases for Cube Packing Boxes<\/h3>\n<p>Our <strong>cube packing boxes<\/strong> are widely used for:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>Branded promotional kits<\/li>\n<li>Event giveaways<\/li>\n<li>Product packaging<\/li>\n<li>Subscription shipments<\/li>\n<li>Bulk storage and shipping<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>You can print them inside-out or keep them plain for a more cost-effective option.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Full Customization with Branding and Print Options<\/h2>\n<h3>Make Your Cube Boxes Stand Out<\/h3>\n<p>Whether you want a simple kraft look or colorful branded packaging, we support various printing options for your <strong>cube cardboard boxes for sale<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Offset or digital printing<\/li>\n<li>CMYK full-color or PMS-specific print<\/li>\n<li>B\/W for budget packaging<\/li>\n<li>Logo, barcode, and QR code support<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3>Finish Options That Protect and Impress<\/h3>\n<p>We offer coatings that serve both aesthetic and functional benefits. Here\u2019s a breakdown of what&#8217;s available:<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<table class=\"border-borderMain dark:border-borderMainDark my-[1em] w-full table-auto border\">\n<thead class=\"bg-offset dark:bg-offsetDark\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff\/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super\/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark\/30 dark:hover:decoration-super\/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline inline-block align-top\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Printing<\/button><\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">CMYK (full color), PMS (spot colors), or Black &amp; White<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">White SBS (Solid Bleached Sulfate), Kraft paper, Recycled paper<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Offset printing, Digital printing, Flexographic printing<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">QR codes, Custom logos, Product information, Variable data printing<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Retail packaging, Custom shipments, Product labels, Marketing kits<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff\/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super\/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark\/30 dark:hover:decoration-super\/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline inline-block align-top\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Thickness<\/button><\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">14pt t